              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolola ndi yaga gekoleki, nyang'anaa nokokola miyinzi vudinyu ligali nindumikiraa zinguru zinene zia Kristo ahaanaa, kandi zikolaa miyinzi mu inzi.",
          "type": "text",
